Algorithm Symbol Notations:

f_gateway: Data packet allocation for fog gateway

μ₁: membership function

RTA: Real Time Analyzer for Real-time deadline sensitive data

d_sd: Real-time deadline sensitive data id

Fuzzy system is generated by inputs and their member functions μ₁

With the function, μ₁(data1), μ₁(data2), get the condition of deadline sensitive applications as μ₁(n data) or μ₁(lor data) or μ₁(hir data)

IF (deadline sensitive applications Condition = μ₁(hir))

THEN find the next allocation

send

An alart to f_gateway gateway using SPARK as RTA

Else If (deadline sensitive applications Condition = μ₁(lor))

THEN the d_sd is sent to f_gateway

